In the data we provide, questions.json and texts.json contains the question and multimodal textual input for all our questions. mp4 files in the "video" further are the videos for our benchmark. Folder full_episode_descriptions are GPT generated descriptions of the interactive scenarios in our benchmark with ground-truth actions and utterances. Folder "raw_video_frames" contains raw frame for each video produced, depth & instance segmentation frames, and other that (camera data, ground truth states, ground truth actions)